 backed into a corner due to doma now  rapidly developing antibodies and  adjusting his body against her poison so  that after a mere five slashes and  injections of poison he is now resistant  to it entirely putting all her hopes on  injecting a large dose to kill him by  using a sick stab attack shinobu attacks  him using insect breathing and  successfully hits him however as she  attacks him he simultaneously attacks  her cutting both her collarbone and ribs  and puncturing one of her lungs shinobu  is called by doma as they fell down from  the ceiling he embraces her in a bear  hug and begins mocking her and calling  her entire attempt to defeat him a waste  of effort assuring her she will live  peacefully as a part of him and  mockingly asking her for her last words  she spitefully curses him as he begins  to kill her doma successfully kills and  eats the hashida just as her disciple  canao arrives at the scene canal enraged  launches her flower breathing at doma  which he avoids with ease smiling and  commenting on how pretty her attack is  inosuke breaks through the ceiling of  the room protecting canal from doma's  attack with his beast breathing during  the battle between doma and two demon  slayers doma's face suddenly begins to  melt he drops to the floor one of his  arms snapping off and his crystal  children begin to crack and disintegrate  as he wonders what's happening inosuke  asks if it's a trap but kano having been  informed prior to the battle of  shinobu's plan to kill doma tells him  that it isn't and that the demon is  being melted by the poison shinobu had  in her body when he consumed her as his  head falls to the floor doma thinks  about how pathetic he must be to have  lost to a poisoner like shinobu someone  who didn't even have the strength to  kill a demon by cutting its head number  one kokushibo kokushibu is by far the  strongest upper moon demon ever holding  the position of upper moon rank one over  four centuries ago kokushibu was a human  by the name of mujicatsu tsugikuni a  former demon slayer and the twin brother  of yorichitsugikuni because of yorichi's  birthmark he was doomed to be sent to  the temple and become a priest upon  turning 10 while michikatsu would become  head of the house one day while  michikatsu was practicing with sword one  of their father's men offered to give  yorichi some instruction as well though  he only showed yorichi a basic stance  the boy was able to land four blows on a  man this incident bewildered michikatsu  who had never before landed a blow and  he begged his brother to teach him a  secret as michikatsu studied the sword  he felt envious of his brother who he  felt was squandering his natural  physical talent he also feared that now  that their father likely knew about  yorichi's immense potential their roles  would be swapped and he would be the one  sent to the temple in yorichi's place  yorichi recognized this as well and left  for the temple before his father could  make him a successor his jealousy of his  brother only grew when he read his  mother's diary following her death which  revealed that yodichi had known  everything about their mother's illness  and had planned accordingly from then  michikatsu resented yorichi who he  realized to be not only physically  gifted but a genius as well he wished  for his brother's death and for the next  few years not hearing anything from him  he believed it to be true ten years  later michikatsu became a samurai and  married a woman who gave birth to two of  his children one night a demon attacked  his camp and left him the only survivor  but was quickly killed by yorichi who  came to his rescue and apologized for  not being able to save his subordinates  seeing the object of his hatred again  when twisted by jealousy michikatsu  abandoned his family and became a demon  slayer to train with yorichi frustrated  for being unable to surpass his brother  as well as fearing the fated death of  those who awaken their demon slayer  marks michikatsu was persuaded by muzan  kibutsuji and became a demon taking the  name kokushibu 60 years after becoming a  demon he came face to face with yorichi  for the last time wanting to forget his  human past he knew he had to kill his  younger brother enraged by the feeling  of inferiority he slashed yodichi's body  in half but inadvertently broke the  flute he gave him as a child seeing that  his brother still thought highly of him  even after his transformation kokushibu  couldn't help but shed a tear unable to  truly sever his bond with his brother he  decided to keep the flute for himself  inside infinity castle kokushibu  encounters missed hashira muichiro  tokito he then deduces that muichiro is  a descendant of a child he left behind  after becoming a demon the two engage in  battle but muichiro is easily defeated  by kokushibu who offers him to become a  demon this discussion is however  interrupted by genya shooting his  nichiren gun kokushibu effortlessly  avoids the gunshot appearing behind  genya and then proceeding to cut off  both his arms and his torso in half as  he goes to finish him off genya's older  brother sanemi appears stopping the  upper moon sanemi and kokushibu then  begin their intense duel with kokushibu  being slightly taken aback at the skill  of the win hashira after some struggling  kokushibu shows glee at the opportunity  to fight such a skilled hashida he was  about to deal a finishing to sanemi but  was stopped by the arrival of gyome the  stone hashira kokoshibo was unable to  retain himself openly stating that he  admired gyome's physical form following  an intense back and forth battle  guilleme reveals his trump card he meant  to save from muzan his demon slayer mark  the battle then begins to pick up  kokushibo's attacks increase with both  intensity and frequency he is able to  sever two of sanemi's fingers and both  demon slayers are reduced to putting all  of their efforts into simply avoiding  his attacks right as it seemed that  sanemy is about to lose muichiro rejoins  the battle saving the other hashida just  in time with the combined force of three  hashidas they finally managed to defeat  kokushibu for good  if you're interested in more demon  slayer content click on this video where  we explain all former and current  hashida
 

